ontributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 36: wheel turn | Wheel and trackpad turn pages at column edges with an inertia lock, Space/Page keys scroll then turn, read-on cue under text pages | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 39: music session transition | One transition path for music mode intents, behavior unchanged | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 42: popover cover | Picture this popover attaches when the text view mounts, fixing first scenes | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 37: music prefs owner | One prefs store with merging partial updates; early volume or mute changes no longer clobber the saved style and Chopin mode | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 24: cleaning | Book cleaning layer: EPUB spine reader, deterministic front/back-matter rules, one cheap Muse judge call for ambiguous sections, removal report, clean:epub CLI | Muse Code (Standard design; Contributor implementation) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 38: heading focus | Scene heading never shows a focus ring, opt-in wheel/keyboard scroll e2e | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 31: skin seam | data-skin attribute with a default token layer and a named icon registry, zero visual change | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n| 2026-10-28 | 40: chapter narration | Kokoro af_heart chapter mp3s with sentence timings on Modal, content-keyed cache, pipeline step, server adapters, contract | Muse Code (Contributor) |\\n===\\n239ed5c Add agent log for GPU fallback follow-up\\n3b92435 Add agent logs for narration task 40\\naa21549 Log task 31 skin seam prompts and transcripts\\n71c55d8 Hide the focus ring on the programmatically focused scene heading\\nf408acc Add task 39 Muse review log\\nNOT-IGNORED\\n# Build output and caches\\nnode_modules/\\n.next/\\nout/\\ndist/\\ncoverage/\\n.vercel/\\n*.tsbuildinfo\\n# Generated by `next dev`, `next build`, or `npx next typegen`; never edit.\\nnext-env.d.ts\\n\\n# Secrets (never commit these; see .env.example for names)\\n.env\\n.env.local\\n.env.*.